# Local secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Auth fails CLOSED, so dev needs a token too — pick anything here, and send the
# same value as `VITE_ENERGY_AGENT_TOKEN` from apps/energy.
AGENT_TOKEN=local-dev-token

# Optional. Without it the Worker falls back to the Workers AI binding, whose
# tool support is weaker — the client then falls back to its deterministic tier.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
